1
00:00:00,098 --> 00:00:02,428
(Leonard:)Wow, it's all
happening so fast.

2
00:00:03,401 --> 00:00:05,071
(Leonard:)Should we just sleep on it?

3
00:00:05,069 --> 00:00:07,899
(Sheldon:)We could, but we
always run the risk

4
00:00:07,905 --> 00:00:09,675
(Sheldon:)of someone else beating
us to the punch.

5
00:00:11,042 --> 00:00:12,212
(Leonard:)You're sure it's good?

6
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:15,040
(Sheldon:)My name is right on
there with yours.

7
00:00:15,046 --> 00:00:18,216
(Sheldon:)That is a surefire
mark of quality.

8
00:00:19,951 --> 00:00:22,021
(Sheldon:)That might as well say
"Directed by Joss Whedon."

9
00:00:25,657 --> 00:00:27,357
(Leonard:)Okay, partner, let's do it.

10
00:00:30,328 --> 00:00:31,928
(Leonard:)Come on.

11
00:00:31,929 --> 00:00:33,829
(Sheldon:)Click the
mouse with me.

12
00:00:37,769 --> 00:00:39,769
(Sheldon:)One...

13
00:00:39,771 --> 00:00:41,141
(Leonard:)two...

14
00:00:41,139 --> 00:00:42,569
(Leonard:)three...

15
00:00:42,573 --> 00:00:43,803
BOTH:
Click.

16
00:00:47,345 --> 00:00:48,615
(Leonard:)Well, we did it.

17
00:00:48,613 --> 00:00:50,583
(Sheldon:)Yes, we did,
my friend.

18
00:00:50,581 --> 00:00:51,611
(Leonard:)Is your tongue blue?

19
00:00:51,616 --> 00:00:55,026
(Sheldon:)I don't want to
talk about it.

